  "description": "<p>⭐ Sweeten your weekend with <strong>Cocktail Making At The Chocolate Cocktail Club</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Highlights</strong><br>\r\n🍫 Indulge in the unique experience of making chocolate-infused cocktails<br>\r\n🥂 Kick off your Saturday with a glass of Prosecco on arrival<br>\r\n🍸 Learn tips and tricks from expert bartenders as you shake and stir two delicious cocktails</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>General Info</strong><br>\r\n📅 Date and Time: Saturdays, doors open at 11:45am, cocktail making starts at 12pm<br>\r\n📍 Location: The Chocolate Cocktail Club, 72 St John Street, Farringdon, EC1M 4DT<br>\r\n👤 Age Requirements: 18+ (please bring ID if you look under 25)<br>\r\n♿ Accessibility: this event is not wheelchair accessible<br>\r\n❗ For this event, all sales are final and tickets can’t be refunded, changed, or modified. For more information, please refer to our <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vSVRJ1Z5-8gFm17oKLfc1rcA_HQk0tfJdZ8J4EOwBjPOBrfX-AvXaaGoq7vPNos-r2V4U4PxCfXUyar/pub\" target=\"_blank\">T&amp;Cs.</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\r\nStep into the UK’s only chocolate bar, The Chocolate Cocktail Club, and discover the sweet side of mixology. Guided by expert bartenders, you'll craft two decadent chocolate cocktails in this 90-minute immersive class. It’s the perfect blend of indulgence and sophistication, making your Saturday a whole lot sweeter! Get your tickets now for Cocktail Making At The Chocolate Cocktail Club in London!</p>",
